      "narrative": "• Activity: No heavy lifting > 10 lbs or strenuous exertion for 2 weeks. May shower after 48 hours; do not submerge incisions in water (no baths/swimming).\n• Wound Care: Keep incisions clean and dry. Steri-strips will fall off spontaneously in 7-10 days.\n• Follow-up: Post-op clinic visit with Dr. Jenkins in 10-14 days (Call 212-555-7010 to schedule).\n• Red Flags: Call immediately or go to nearest ED for fever > 101°F, intractable vomiting, worsening abdominal pain, or redness/purulent drainage from incisions.",
